#NEXUS

[ sancarlo2026a_fig14: Tyrannosauroid Bayesian tree, read by eye at 2x (a small image, 671x848 px); no clade names are printed. Polytomies: Stokesosaurus-Juratyrant-Eotyrannus-the rest; Appalachiosaurus-the Dryptosaurus clade-the rest; Thanatotheristes-D.torosus-D.horneri and T.rex-T.regina-T.imperator (in both the stem enters at the middle tip's level, read as entering the node, as in earlier batches). Replacement for turner2012a_fig59 (seed 20261232). 42 tips, 4 polytomies (4, 3, 3, 3 children). Sample 6 case (census 2 extended to draw 120, seed 20261231). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

